OL,3,GNEWSASummer wildfire call-outs more
OL,4,Athan double
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe number of Lincolnshire wildfires
OL,7,Fthis summer is more than double the
OL,8,Famount reported during the same period
OL,9,Fin 2025, a fire service says.
OL,11,FLincolnshire Fire and Rescue said it
OL,12,Fattended 58 during June, July and
OL,13,FAugust, up from 26 the previous year.
OL,15,FThe service said they were part of
OL,16,F2,700 incidents, which included false
OL,17,Falarm, fire and special service,
OL,18,Fbetween 1 June and 25 August, up from
OL,19,F2,022 in 2025.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
