OL,3,GNEWSASummer wildfire call-outs more
OL,4,Athan double
OL,5,
OL,6,FChief fire officer Mark Baxter said:
OL,7,F"It has been fairly relentless in
OL,8,Fregards to the amount of incidents our
OL,9,Ffirefighters have attended."
